n> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_SHA_SilentLibrary_SharranBook_004</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_SHA_SilentLibrary_SharranBook_004\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_SHA_SilentLibrary_SharranBook_004\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">a109cbd0-7a3b-4378-8938-27f0afa56d38</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a109cbd0-7a3b-4378-8938-27f0afa56d38\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a109cbd0-7a3b-4378-8938-27f0afa56d38\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a bookshelf in the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar#The_Silent_Library\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Silent Library</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-776&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-767</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Love is the cruellest of all the lies used by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/30px-Shar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/40px-Shar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Shar's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Lady Shar's</a> foes. It is a disease - one that can ensnare hearts for a lifetime over something as slight as a passing glimpse. Love is arsony - a destructive flame, offering fleeting light and comfort to the one who feeds it, while insulting Lady Shar's cold, infinite darkness. Extinguish the fires of love - they shall burn you with their heat, choke you with their acrid smoke, and, in the end, leave you with nothing but cold ashes and a hungry heart.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Teachings_of_Loss:_Dark_Justiciar\" title=\"Teachings of Loss: Dark Justiciar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><